{"id":"c1628927-c677-4f0e-97d6-28aa5822e1aa","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:17:18.349Z","batchId":"settings_claude-haiku-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, how we contact you, and who can see your activity.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This information appears on your public profile and in comments.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Verified</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">AR</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Change photo</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Remove</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-sm\">\n      <label>Full name\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"Alex Rivera\">\n      </label>\n      <label>Display name\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"alexr\">\n      </label>\n      <label>Email\n        <input type=\"email\" value=\"alex.rivera@example.com\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Used for sign-in and receipts.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label>Time zone\n        <select>\n          <option selected>(UTC+00:00) London</option>\n          <option>(UTC-05:00) New York</option>\n          <option>(UTC+09:00) Tokyo</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n    <label>Bio\n      <textarea rows=\"3\">Product designer working on accessibility and design systems.</textarea>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">120 characters remaining.</span>\n    </label>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Save profile</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\">Discard changes</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which updates you receive and where they are sent.</p>\n    </div>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Notification</th><th>Email</th><th>Push</th><th>SMS</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Security alerts</td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Comments and mentions</td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Weekly digest</td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Product news and tips</td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n          <td><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> On</label></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Security alerts cannot be turned off for email.</span>\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Save notifications</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can see your activity and how your data is used.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Public profile</strong>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Anyone with the link can view your name and bio.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Visible</label>\n    </div>\n    <hr>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Show online status</strong>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Let teammates see when you are active.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Visible</label>\n    </div>\n    <hr>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Usage analytics</strong>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Help us improve by sharing anonymous usage data.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Enabled</label>\n    </div>\n    <hr>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <strong>Profile visibility in search</strong>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Allow search engines to index your public profile.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Off</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Danger zone</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">These actions are permanent or affect your whole account.</p>\n    </div>